% blocked depends positively on depends and unfinished, and ready negates
% blocked.  Strata are assigned minimally, so blocked shares stratum 0 with
% its positive dependencies and ready gets stratum 1.  What matters, and what
% this pins, is that ready sits strictly above blocked.
depends(a, b).
unfinished(b).
todo(a).
blocked(X) :- depends(X, Y), unfinished(Y).
ready(X) :- todo(X), not blocked(X).
